{
  "id": "597",
  "title": "Ben’s Diary – I Didn’t Bring An Umbrella",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-10-10",
  "synopsis": "Ben writes about not having an umbrella when it was raining heavily.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/859/8d4a92cceae550dea1f1bbcc51a0ba8607cde079.mp3?1589791829",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 4: Trouble in Paradise",
    "chapter": 8,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "本的日记-我没有带伞\n\n    今天我在图书馆学习。我学了很长时间，很累。下午7点，我从图书馆出来，外面下着大雨，我没有带伞。怎么办？跑回家？再回图书馆学习？我不想跑，我也不想再回图书馆了。我饿了，我想吃饭。这时，小雨从图书馆出来。她带伞了，她和我一起去吃饭了。",
    "traditional": "本的日記-我沒有帶傘\n\n    今天我在圖書館學習。我學了很長時間，很累。下午7點，我從圖書館出來，外面下著大雨，我沒有帶傘。怎麼辦？跑回家？再回圖書館學習？我不想跑，我也不想再回圖書館了。我餓了，我想吃飯。這時，小雨從圖書館出來。她帶傘了，她和我一起去吃飯了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben’s Diary – I Didn’t Bring An Umbrella"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天我在图书馆学习。",
      "traditional": "今天我在圖書館學習。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ zài tú shū guǎn xué xí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我学了很长时间，很累。",
      "traditional": "我學了很長時間，很累。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xué le hěn cháng shí jiān hěn lèi",
      "english": "Today I was studying at the library."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "下午7点，我从图书馆出来，外面下着大雨，我没有带伞。",
      "traditional": "下午7點，我從圖書館出來，外面下著大雨，我沒有帶傘。",
      "pinyin": "xià wǔ 1 diǎn wǒ cóng tú shū guǎn chū lái wài miàn xià zhe dà yǔ wǒ méi yǒu dài sǎn",
      "english": "I had studied for a long time and was very tired."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "怎么办？跑回家？再回图书馆学习？",
      "traditional": "怎麼辦？跑回家？再回圖書館學習？",
      "pinyin": "zěn me bàn pǎo huí jiā zài huí tú shū guǎn xué xí",
      "english": "At 7 PM, I went out of the library. It rained heavily outside, and I hadn’t brought an umbrella."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我不想跑，我也不想再回图书馆了。",
      "traditional": "我不想跑，我也不想再回圖書館了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ bù xiǎng pǎo wǒ yě bù xiǎng zài huí tú shū guǎn le",
      "english": "What should I do? Run home? Go back into the library and study?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我饿了，我想吃饭。",
      "traditional": "我餓了，我想吃飯。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ è le wǒ xiǎng chī fàn",
      "english": "I didn’t want to run, and I didn’t want to go back into the library either."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "这时，小雨从图书馆出来。",
      "traditional": "這時，小雨從圖書館出來。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shí xiǎo yǔ cóng tú shū guǎn chū lái",
      "english": "I was hungry and wanted to have a meal."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "她带伞了，她和我一起去吃饭了。",
      "traditional": "她帶傘了，她和我一起去吃飯了。",
      "pinyin": "tā dài sǎn le tā hé wǒ yì qǐ qù chī fàn le",
      "english": "Just then, Little Yu came out from the library."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "She had brought an umbrella, and she and I went to have a meal together."
    }
  ],
