    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – I Didn’t Bring An Umbrella",
      "",
      "Today I was studying at the library.",
      "I had studied for a long time and was very tired.",
      "At 7 PM, I went out of the library. It rained heavily outside, and I hadn’t brought an umbrella.",
      "What should I do? Run home? Go back into the library and study?",
      "I didn’t want to run, and I didn’t want to go back into the library either.",
      "I was hungry and wanted to have a meal.",
      "Just then, Little Yu came out from the library.",
      "She had brought an umbrella, and she and I went to have a meal together.",
      ""
